tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Throw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Throw","referenceId":"reference:c78054582e89a9a7"}," two weapons simultaneously. Both weapons target the same enemy or target square and are thrown with one hand. Make separate attack rolls for each weapon, each at a -10 penalty. The weapons must be similar, such as two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"}," or two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knives"},", and they must be no larger than one size category smaller than you. The attack cannot exceed Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," (typically 8 squares).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
